        "Original character in a cinematic scene."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Maxi has bright BLUE EYES, vivid azure-blue irises surrounding black pupils, visible clearly through thin round amber eyeglasses. Full-body premium cinematic 3D animation character portrait of one androgynous eight-year-old child with a softly oval face, small chin, fair peach skin, subtle rosy cheeks and a thoughtful shy smile. Tousled chin-length medium brown WAVY hair, irregular off-center part, layered outward curling locks and soft flyaways. Slender school-age arms and legs. Mustard yellow cotton T-shirt, muted sea-green denim short overalls with brass buttons, rolled cuffs and one small coral-orange bib pocket, cream lace-up canvas shoes with dark sole piping. Standing with one hand touching their chin and the other holding a teal sand bucket, eyes glancing slightly upward. Warm cream seamless studio background, soft warm bounced light, detailed groomed hair, tactile woven fabric, sophisticated sculpted feature-animation face. Entire figure and shoes in frame. One character. Blue irises, blue eyes. No text."
      }
